@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title GET /api/workspace/v1/messenger/files/{file_uuid}/actions/download
actor "The client ." as Client
participant "Controller is RestAlchemy" as API
database "Metadata from the file + ACL - What ? PostgreSQL" as DB
database "Configure the file storage" as STORE
Client -> API: GET Downloading
API -> DB: indexed metadata + check ACL
DB --> API: locator The storage room . + hash
API -> STORE: read unchanged bytes
STORE --> API: bytes
note right of API: without outbox / tasks / events
API --> Client: 200 bytes + ETag
@enduml
